            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "These seeds... Where did you even find these seeds, I wonder?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750304"
            ]
          },
          "732750304": {
            "id": "732750304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "From a far-off place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750305"
            ]
          },
          "732750305": {
            "id": "732750305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Did you indeed? Well, I suppose that the seeds Uncle Shafaqat sowed really did find their way back here in the end after being spread to every corner of the desert — even if the path they took meandered quite a bit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750307"
            ]
          },
          "732750307": {
            "id": "732750307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "We'll have to take good care of these seedlings — I intend to leave them to young Sabbah. Once I, too, am gone, these flowers shall pass on to her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750308"
            ]
          },
          "732750308": {
            "id": "732750308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "You've truly helped this old man out, and you asked for no reward — but ah, I would have trouble sleeping tonight if I didn't give you a little something at least.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750309"
            ]
          },
          "732750309": {
            "id": "732750309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "This seedling recently broke through the soil, and Sabbah suggested giving it to you. She even wrapped it up nicely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750310"
            ]
          },
          "732750310": {
            "id": "732750310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Take it as a memento from us. May you be as resilient as this seedling, and may you always keep the faith."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7327504",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732750401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732750401": {
            "id": "732750401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "♪ ... Ah. It's you. Come, come. These flowers are growing well, are they not?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7327505",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732750501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732750501": {
            "id": "732750501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about the folk song...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750502"
            ]
          },
          "732750502": {
            "id": "732750502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Ah, so you've remembered it, eh? Well, that makes one more young person who knows it. Good, good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750503"
            ]
          },
          "732750503": {
            "id": "732750503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "\"Rose, oh rose, grant me my wish. Blooming from the stone, the Golden Rose sang to me.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750504"
            ]
          },
          "732750504": {
            "id": "732750504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "\"No land but folk songs bore my spirit. Songs shall defy my fate, and overcome my destiny.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750505"
            ]
          },
          "732750505": {
            "id": "732750505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "\"They will surpass me, surpass time. They will surpass the ever-lasting withering of life...\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7327506",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732750601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732750601": {
            "id": "732750601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "See you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732750602"
            ]
          },
          "732750602": {
            "id": "732750602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "You have a good heart, child. May the gods watch over you and that heart of yours. See you."
          }
        }
      }
    }
